  "job_B14.29_20251003_114308": {
    "text": "Cnut cyning gret his arcebiscopas & his leodbiscopas & \u00feurcyl eorl & ealle his eorlas & ealne his\n& ic cy\u00f0e eow, \u00fe\u00e6t ic wylle beon hold hlaford & unswicende to Godes gerihtum & to rihtre woroldlage.\nIc nam me to gemynde \u00fea gewritu & \u00fea word, \u00fee se arcebiscop Lyfing me fram \u00feam papan brohte of\nNu ne wandode ic na minum sceattum, \u00fea hwile \u00fee eow unfri\u00f0 on handa stod; nu ic mid Godes fultume\n\u00dea cydde man me, \u00fe\u00e6t us mara hearm to fundode, \u00feonne us wel licode; & \u00fea for ic me sylf mid \u00feam\n& \u00fe\u00e6t h\u00e6bbe mid Godes fultume forene forfangen, \u00fe\u00e6t eow n\u00e6fre heonon for\u00f0 \u00feanon nan unfri\u00f0 to ne\nNu \u00f0ancige ic Gode \u00e6lmihtigum his fultumes & his mildheortnesse, \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00fea myclan hearmas, \u00fee us to\nNu wylle ic, \u00fe\u00e6t we ealle eadmodlice Gode \u00e6lmihtigum \u00feancian \u00fe\u00e6re mildheortnesse, \u00fee he us to\nNu bidde ic mine arcebiscopas & ealle mine leodbiscopas, \u00fe\u00e6t hy ealle neodfulle beon ymbe Godes\nGif hwa swa dyrstig sy, gehadod o\u00f0\u00f0e l\u00e6wede, Denisc o\u00f0\u00f0e Englisc, \u00fe\u00e6t ongean Godes lage ga &\nGyf he ne m\u00e6ge, \u00feonne wille ic, mid uncer begra cr\u00e6fte \u00fe\u00e6t he hine on earde adw\u00e6sce o\u00f0\u00f0e ut of earde\n& eac ic beode eallum minum gerefum, be minum freondscype & be eallum \u00feam \u00fee hi agon & be heora\n& gyf hwa \u00feeof fri\u00f0ige o\u00f0\u00f0e forena forlicge, sy he emscyldig wi\u00f0 me \u00feam \u00f0e \u00feeof scolde, buton he\n& ic wylle, \u00fe\u00e6t eal \u00feeodscype, gehadode & l\u00e6wede, f\u00e6stlice Eadgares lage healde, \u00fee ealle men\nFor \u00f0am \u00fee ealle biscopas secga\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t hit swy\u00fee deop wi\u00f0 God to betanne, \u00fe\u00e6t man a\u00f0as o\u00f0\u00f0e wedd\n& eac hy us fur\u00f0or l\u00e6ra\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t we sceolon eallan magene & eallon myhton \u00feone ecan mildan God inlice\n& eac we beoda\u00f0 on Godes \u00e6lmihtiges naman & on ealra his haligra, \u00fe\u00e6t nan man swa dyrstig ne sy,\n& gyf hit hwa gedon h\u00e6bbe, beo he utlah wi\u00f0 God & amansumod fram eallum Cristendome & wi\u00f0\n& gyt we fur\u00f0or mania\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t man Sunnand\u00e6ges freols mid eallum m\u00e6gene healde & weor\u00f0ige fram\n& ealle men, earme & eadige, heora cyrcan secean & for heora synnum \u00feingian & \u00e6lc beboden f\u00e6stan",
